---
import { SITE } from '../consts';
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base
  title="Contact"
  description="How to reach the author of this site, and what does and doesn't get a reply."
>
  <h1>Contact</h1>

  <p class="lede">
    Email: <a href={`mailto:${SITE.email}`}>{SITE.email}</a>
  </p>
  <p>
    I run this site alone and usually reply within a few working days.
  </p>

  <h2>Please do send</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Corrections</strong> — factual errors, stale numbers, holes in the methodology. These always get a reply.</li>
    <li><strong>Counter-results</strong> — you got a different outcome with the same tool. Tell me your environment and version.</li>
    <li><strong>Suggestions</strong> — a tool you'd like tested. I only write about things I'd actually use, but I'm listening.</li>
    <li><strong>Partnership enquiries</strong> — see below.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>If you make a product</h2>
  <p>
    I'll accept a trial account. I <strong>won't accept payment for a positive review</strong>. A trial doesn't guarantee coverage, and coverage doesn't guarantee a favourable conclusion. Anything paid gets labelled as sponsored and kept separate from regular testing — the rules are in the <a href="/affiliate-disclosure/">affiliate disclosure</a>.
  </p>

  <h2>Please don't send</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Link exchanges, paid backlinks, or guest posts.</li>
    <li>AI-generated pitches.</li>
    <li>Promotions unrelated to this site's subject — it's AI tools and workflows here, nothing else.</li>
  </ul>
</Base>
